  'readiness.walletconnect.reason': 'The wallet now shows whether WalletConnect’s verification service confirms which website a connected app really is, and it summarizes token-permit signatures (Permit and Permit2) as a plain spender, amount and expiry. Both are built and tested offline but have not yet been exercised with a live app over the WalletConnect relay, so connecting to apps is not yet cleared for real funds.',
