  'settings.appPin.what': 'With a PIN, the wallet\'s own lock screen asks for a 6-digit PIN each time the wallet is opened and after auto-lock, instead of your fingerprint or face. The PIN is an extra lock inside this app: your device\'s own lock still protects the secure storage that holds your recovery phrase, and sending still asks for your fingerprint, face or device passcode.',
  'settings.appPin.limits': 'What the PIN does not protect against: someone who copies this app\'s storage from the phone can try every 6-digit PIN on a computer, so the PIN stops guessing at the screen only. After 5 wrong PINs the lock screen waits 30 seconds, and the wait doubles with each further wrong PIN up to 1 hour; it never wipes the wallet. There is no PIN reset: if you forget it, clear the app\'s data or reinstall it, and restore the wallet from your recovery phrase.',
  'settings.appPin.costs': 'While the PIN is on, auto-lock cannot be turned off, screen protection stays on, and the wallet posts no notifications: no reminders for recurring payments or swaps, no price alerts, and no alert when someone starts a recovery or takeover of one of your accounts. You see those the next time you open the wallet.',
  'settings.appPin.on': 'The app PIN is on.',
