  'accounts.watch.intro': 'Follow any Ethereum address without its key: its balances, tokens, activity and NFTs appear like an account’s, but the wallet cannot sign, swap or recover anything for it. A send on an Ethereum network can still be prepared here and signed by an off-line signer that holds its key.',
  'accounts.watch.privacy': 'Watching an address reveals your interest in it to the network endpoints and indexers this wallet uses (Settings → Network endpoints and the history and NFT indexers), because the wallet asks them about this address.',
